  <jpigp_cor:NotesGoodwillAndIntangibleAssetsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsIFRSTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;13．のれん及び無形資産&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;"&gt;(1) 増減表&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;text-indent:9pt;"&gt;のれん及び無形資産の取得原価、償却累計額及び減損損失累計額の増減及び帳簿価額は以下のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;取得原価&lt;/p&gt;
